{"id":"61e20cf392ca62079666fe028aef7b276d084991","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/camel","sha":"61e20cf392ca62079666fe028aef7b276d084991","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/images/jbang/camel-tui-chaos.png","lines":["Binary files /dev/null and b/docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/images/jbang/camel-tui-chaos.png differ"],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/pages/camel-jbang-tui-observe.adoc","lines":["@@ -240,6 +240,28 @@ right panel. While sending, the status shows a spinner."," "," Beyond the core tabs described above, the TUI includes several specialized screens worth highlighting."," ","+=== Chaos","+","+With xref:next@components:others:chaos.adoc[camel-chaos] (`camel run --chaos`), the Chaos tab (under More >","+Observability) shows the faults that the chaos rules inject into the running integration, and what they do:","+","+* The verdict of the report (PASS or FAIL with the reason), the messages lost, the expectations (met, unmet, pending)","+and the faults of all rules in the last minute.","+* The rules: target, fault, the observed rate next to the rate of the rule (`24% of 25%`), how often and how long ago it","+fired, its faults per second over the last minute as a sparkline, the effect of its faults on the exchanges (completed,","+recovered by redelivery, handled by the error handler, failed, in flight), and a note (when it ends or starts, its","+bursts, what a stall or lifecycle rule does to its route).","+* The selected rule in detail: the effect as a bar, its expectation with the time left, why it skipped faults, and its","+recent faults with the endpoint or step, the route and the exchange.","+* The counts of the report per route: completed, failed, kept by the consumer, handled, redeliveries.","+","+image::jbang/camel-tui-chaos.png[The Chaos tab: a failed expectation, four rules with their live state, and the recent faults of the selected rule]","+","+While a rule injects faults, the title bar shows a badge on every screen (`🎲 chaos 3 rules · FAIL`), so a failure made","+on purpose is not debugged as a real one. The tab only reads: add, change and remove rules with `camel cmd chaos-add`,","+`chaos-change`, `chaos-remove` and `chaos-clear` (see","+xref:next@components:others:chaos.adoc#_control_while_it_runs[Control while it runs]).","+"," === CVE Audit"," "," The CVE Audit tab (under More > Project) scans all Maven dependencies on your integration's classpath"],"additions":22,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/user-manual/modules/ROOT/pages/camel-jbang-tui.adoc","lines":["@@ -80,14 +80,15 @@ to any tab, or *Shift+F2* to go to a tab by name."," The *More* menu (key *0*) opens a popup with tabs organized into groups:"," "," * *Routing* -- Browse Endpoints, Consumers, HTTP, Inflight, Producers, Route Controller","-* *Observability* -- Circuit Breaker, Health, JFR, Metrics, Network Services, Exchange Events, Recovery Tasks, OpenTelemetry Spans","+* *Observability* -- Chaos, Circuit Breaker, Health, JFR, Metrics, Network Services, Exchange Events, Recovery Tasks, OpenTelemetry Spans"," * *AI* -- Semantic (definitions, expert contracts, relationships, sample evaluation, Audit and Monitoring), Ollama (listed when an Ollama server is detected)"," * *Data* -- JDBC DataSource, Kafka, Secrets, SQL Query, SQL Trace"," * *JVM* -- Classpath, Heap Memory Histogram, Memory Usage, Memory Leak, Process, Startup, Threads"," * *Project* -- Beans, Catalog, Configuration, CVE Audit, Maven Dependencies, Type Converters, Data Type Transformers"," "," Tabs appear dynamically based on what the integration uses. For example, the Kafka tab appears","-when a Kafka component is in use, SQL tabs when a DataSource is present, Circuit Breaker when","+when a Kafka component is in use, SQL tabs when a DataSource is present, Chaos when the integration has","+xref:next@components:others:chaos.adoc[camel-chaos] (`camel run --chaos`), Circuit Breaker when"," resilience4j is in use, Spans when OpenTelemetry is enabled, and JFR when `camel-jfr` is on the"," classpath. The TUI adapts to show only what's relevant to your integration."," "],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"dsl/camel-jbang/camel-jbang-plugin-tui/src/main/java/org/apache/camel/dsl/jbang/core/commands/tui/CamelMonitor.java","lines":["@@ -1875,8 +1875,8 @@ private void renderHeader(Frame frame, Rect area) {","                 monitorNotification = null;","             }","         }","-        // Right-aligned header spans (web server indicator)","-        List<Span> headerRight = new ArrayList<>();","+        // Right-aligned header spans (the chaos badge, web server indicator)","+        List<Span> headerRight = new ArrayList<>(ChaosTab.headerBadge(ctx.findSelectedIntegration()));","         if (web && webBackend == null) {","             headerRight.add(Span.styled(\"web :\" + webPort + \" \",","                     Theme.notice().underlined().hyperlink(\"http://127.0.0.1:\" + webPort + \"/\")));"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"dsl/camel-jbang/camel-jbang-plugin-tui/src/main/java/org/apache/camel/dsl/jbang/core/commands/tui/ChaosInfo.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,324 @@","+/*","+ * Licensed to the Apache Software Foundation (ASF) under one or more","+ * contributor license agreements.  See the NOTICE file distributed with","+ * this work for additional information regarding copyright ownership.","+ * The ASF licenses this file to You under the Apache License, Version 2.0","+ * (the \"License\"); you may not use this file except in compliance with","+ * the License.  You may obtain a copy of the License at","+ *","+ *      http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+ *","+ * Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+ * distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+ * WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+ * See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+ * limitations under the License.","+ */","+package org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.core.commands.tui;","+","+import java.util.ArrayList;","+import java.util.LinkedHashMap;","+import java.util.List;","+import java.util.Map;","+","+import org.apache.camel.util.json.JsonArray;","+import org.apache.camel.util.json.JsonObject;","+","+/**","+ * The chaos section of the status of an integration (the {@code chaos} dev console of camel-chaos): whether chaos is","+ * on, the current rules with their live state, and the report (verdict, counts per route, recent faults). Parsed","+ * leniently: a camel-chaos of another version may leave fields out, which then read as unknown (-1 or null).","+ */","+final class ChaosInfo {","+","+    boolean enabled;","+    // why chaos is off","+    String reason;","+    String verdict;","+    boolean isFinal = true;","+    long seed;","+    boolean seedGiven;","+    long lost;","+    final List<String> reasons = new ArrayList<>();","+    final List<Rule> rules = new ArrayList<>();","+    final List<RouteCounts> routes = new ArrayList<>();","+    final List<RecentFault> recentFaults = new ArrayList<>();","+","+    /** A current rule, with its live state. */","+    static final class Rule {","+        String id;","+        int version;","+        String text;","+        String state;","+        long matches;","+        long fired;","+        long skipped;","+        final Map<String, Long> skippedReasons = new LinkedHashMap<>();","+        long lostAtDlq = -1;","+        long endsIn = -1;","+        long startsIn = -1;","+        double rate = -1;","+        double observedRate = -1;","+        long nextFireIn = -1;","+        long burstEndsIn = -1;","+        long nextBurstIn = -1;","+        long lastFiredAgo = -1;","+        long faultsLastMinute;","+        long[] faultsPerSecond = new long[0];","+        // the effect of its faults; faulted is 0 until it faulted an exchange","+        long faulted;","+        long completed;","+        long recovered;","+        long handled;","+        long failed;","+        long inFlight;","+        // the expectation, or null","+        String expectRoute;","+        String expectKind;","+        String expectOp;","+        long expectCount;","+        long expectValue;","+        String expectOutcome;","+        long expectTimeLeft = -1;","+        // what a stall or lifecycle rule did to its route, or null","+        String lifecycleAction;","+        String lifecycleRoute;","+        String lifecycleState;","+        int lifecycleRound;","+        int lifecycleRepeat;","+        long lifecycleActsIn = -1;","+        long lifecycleBackIn = -1;","+        String lifecycleReason;","+","+        /** The target of the rule as it is written, such as {@code endpoint=kafka:orders*}. */","+        String target() {","+            for (String token : tokens()) {","+                if (token.startsWith(\"endpoint=\") || token.startsWith(\"component=\") || token.startsWith(\"route=\")","+                        || token.startsWith(\"step=\")) {","+                    return token;","+                }","+            }","+            return \"\";","+        }","+","+        /**","+         * The fault of the rule with its parameters, as it is written, without the target and the options of the rule","+         * (at, rate, until, from, expect, within), such as {@code error status=503}.","+         */","+        String fault() {","+            StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();","+            for (String token : tokens()) {","+                int eq = token.indexOf('=');","+                String key = eq > 0 ? token.substring(0, eq) : null;","+                if (token.equals(target()) || key != null && OPTIONS.contains(key)) {","+                    continue;","+                }","+                if (!sb.isEmpty()) {","+                    sb.append(' ');","+                }","+                sb.append(token);","+            }","+            return sb.toString();","+        }","+","+        /** The options at, rate, until and from as they are written, for the RATE column. */","+        String option(String name) {","+            for (String token : tokens()) {","+                if (token.startsWith(name + \"=\")) {","+                    return token.substring(name.length() + 1);","+                }","+            }","+            return null;","+        }","+","+        /** The rule split at the spaces that are not inside a quoted value. */","+        List<String> tokens() {","+            List<String> answer = new ArrayList<>();","+            if (text == null) {","+                return answer;","+            }","+            StringBuilder current = new StringBuilder();","+            char quote = 0;","+            for (int i = 0; i < text.length(); i++) {","+                char ch = text.charAt(i);","+                if (quote != 0) {","+                    current.append(ch);","+                    if (ch == quote) {","+                        quote = 0;","+                    }","+                } else if (ch == ' ' || ch == '\\t') {","+                    if (!current.isEmpty()) {","+                        answer.add(current.toString());","+                        current.setLength(0);","+                    }","+                } else {","+                    if (ch == '\"' || ch == '\\'') {","+                        quote = ch;","+                    }","+                    current.append(ch);","+                }","+            }","+            if (!current.isEmpty()) {","+                answer.add(current.toString());","+            }","+            return answer;","+        }","+","+        boolean isActive() {","+            return \"active\".equals(state) || \"waiting\".equals(state);","+        }","+    }","+","+    // the options of a rule besides its target and its fault","+    private static final List<String> OPTIONS = List.of(\"at\", \"rate\", \"until\", \"from\", \"expect\", \"within\");","+","+    /** The counts of a route in the report. */","+    record RouteCounts(String route, long completed, long failed, long failedKept, long handled, long redeliveries) {","+    }","+","+    /** A recent fault of a rule. */","+    record RecentFault(long ago, String rule, String fault, String hook, String route, String where, String exchangeId) {","+    }","+","+    /** The active (and waiting) rules. */","+    long activeRules() {","+        return rules.stream().filter(Rule::isActive).count();","+    }","+","+    /** The faults of all rules in the last minute. */","+    long faultsLastMinute() {","+        return rules.stream().mapToLong(r -> r.faultsLastMinute).sum();","+    }","+","+    /** The current rule with the id, or null. */","+    Rule rule(String id) {","+        for (Rule r : rules) {","+            if (r.id != null && r.id.equals(id)) {","+                return r;","+            }","+        }","+        return null;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Parses the chaos section of the status.","+     *","+     * @return the chaos info, or null when there is no section (the integration has no camel-chaos)","+     */","+    static ChaosInfo parse(JsonObject chaos) {","+        if (chaos == null) {","+            return null;","+        }","+        ChaosInfo info = new ChaosInfo();","+        info.enabled = chaos.getBooleanOrDefault(\"enabled\", false);","+        info.reason = chaos.getString(\"reason\");","+        if (chaos.get(\"rules\") instanceof JsonArray rules) {","+            for (Object o : rules) {","+                if (o instanceof JsonObject jo) {","+                    info.rules.add(rule(jo));","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        if (chaos.get(\"report\") instanceof JsonObject report) {","+            info.verdict = report.getString(\"verdict\");","+            info.isFinal = report.getBooleanOrDefault(\"final\", true);","+            info.seed = num(report.get(\"seed\"), 0);","+            info.seedGiven = report.getBooleanOrDefault(\"seedGiven\", false);","+            info.lost = num(report.get(\"lost\"), 0);","+            if (report.get(\"reasons\") instanceof JsonArray reasons) {","+                reasons.forEach(r -> info.reasons.add(String.valueOf(r)));","+            }","+            if (report.get(\"routes\") instanceof JsonArray routes) {","+                for (Object o : routes) {","+                    if (o instanceof JsonObject r) {","+                        info.routes.add(new RouteCounts(","+                                r.getString(\"route\"), num(r.get(\"completed\"), 0), num(r.get(\"failed\"), 0),","+                                num(r.get(\"failedKeptByConsumer\"), 0), num(r.get(\"handled\"), 0),","+                                num(r.get(\"redeliveries\"), 0)));","+                    }","+                }","+            }","+            if (report.get(\"recentFaults\") instanceof JsonArray faults) {","+                for (Object o : faults) {","+                    if (o instanceof JsonObject f) {","+                        String where = f.getString(\"endpoint\") != null ? f.getString(\"endpoint\") : f.getString(\"step\");","+                        info.recentFaults.add(new RecentFault(","+                                num(f.get(\"ago\"), -1), f.getString(\"rule\"), f.getString(\"fault\"), f.getString(\"hook\"),","+                                f.getString(\"route\"), where, f.getString(\"exchangeId\")));","+                    }","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        return info;","+    }","+","+    private static Rule rule(JsonObject jo) {","+        Rule r = new Rule();","+        r.id = jo.getString(\"id\");","+        r.version = (int) num(jo.get(\"version\"), 1);","+        r.text = jo.getString(\"rule\");","+        r.state = jo.getString(\"state\");","+        r.matches = num(jo.get(\"matches\"), 0);","+        if (jo.get(\"fired\") instanceof Map<?, ?> fired) {","+            for (Object v : fired.values()) {","+                r.fired += num(v, 0);","+            }","+        }","+        r.skipped = num(jo.get(\"skipped\"), 0);","+        if (jo.get(\"skippedReasons\") instanceof Map<?, ?> reasons) {","+            reasons.forEach((k, v) -> r.skippedReasons.put(String.valueOf(k), num(v, 0)));","+        }","+        r.lostAtDlq = num(jo.get(\"lostAtDlq\"), -1);","+        r.endsIn = num(jo.get(\"endsIn\"), -1);","+        r.startsIn = num(jo.get(\"startsIn\"), -1);","+        r.rate = dbl(jo.get(\"rate\"));","+        r.observedRate = dbl(jo.get(\"observedRate\"));","+        r.nextFireIn = num(jo.get(\"nextFireIn\"), -1);","+        r.burstEndsIn = num(jo.get(\"burstEndsIn\"), -1);","+        r.nextBurstIn = num(jo.get(\"nextBurstIn\"), -1);","+        r.lastFiredAgo = num(jo.get(\"lastFiredAgo\"), -1);","+        r.faultsLastMinute = num(jo.get(\"faultsLastMinute\"), 0);","+        if (jo.get(\"faultsPerSecond\") instanceof List<?> perSecond) {","+            r.faultsPerSecond = new long[perSecond.size()];","+            for (int i = 0; i < perSecond.size(); i++) {","+                r.faultsPerSecond[i] = num(perSecond.get(i), 0);","+            }","+        }","+        if (jo.get(\"effect\") instanceof JsonObject e) {","+            r.faulted = num(e.get(\"faulted\"), 0);","+            r.completed = num(e.get(\"completed\"), 0);","+            r.recovered = num(e.get(\"recovered\"), 0);","+            r.handled = num(e.get(\"handled\"), 0);","+            r.failed = num(e.get(\"failed\"), 0);","+            r.inFlight = num(e.get(\"inFlight\"), 0);","+        }","+        if (jo.get(\"expectation\") instanceof JsonObject e) {","+            r.expectRoute = e.getString(\"route\");","+            r.expectKind = e.getStringOrDefault(\"kind\", \"completed\");","+            r.expectOp = e.getStringOrDefault(\"op\", \">=\");","+            r.expectCount = num(e.get(\"count\"), 0);","+            r.expectValue = num(e.get(\"value\") != null ? e.get(\"value\") : e.get(\"completed\"), 0);","+            r.expectOutcome = e.getString(\"outcome\");","+            r.expectTimeLeft = num(e.get(\"timeLeft\"), -1);","+        }","+        if (jo.get(\"lifecycle\") instanceof JsonObject l) {","+            r.lifecycleAction = l.getString(\"action\");","+            r.lifecycleRoute = l.getString(\"route\");","+            r.lifecycleState = l.getString(\"state\");","+            r.lifecycleRound = (int) num(l.get(\"round\"), 0);","+            r.lifecycleRepeat = (int) num(l.get(\"repeat\"), 1);","+            r.lifecycleActsIn = num(l.get(\"actsIn\"), -1);","+            r.lifecycleBackIn = num(l.get(\"backIn\"), -1);","+            r.lifecycleReason = l.getString(\"reason\");","+        }","+        return r;","+    }","+","+    private static long num(Object value, long otherwise) {","+        return value instanceof Number n ? n.longValue() : otherwise;","+    }","+","+    private static double dbl(Object value) {","+        return value instanceof Number n ? n.doubleValue() : -1;","+    }","+}"],"additions":324,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"dsl/camel-jbang/camel-jbang-plugin-tui/src/main/java/org/apache/camel/dsl/jbang/core/commands/tui/ChaosTab.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,676 @@","+/*","+ * Licensed to the Apache Software Foundation (ASF) under one or more","+ * contributor license agreements.  See the NOTICE file distributed with","+ * this work for additional information regarding copyright ownership.","+ * The ASF licenses this file to You under the Apache License, Version 2.0","+ * (the \"License\"); you may not use this file except in compliance with","+ * the License.  You may obtain a copy of the License at","+ *","+ *      http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0","+ *","+ * Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software","+ * distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,","+ * WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.","+ * See the License for the specific language governing permissions and","+ * limitations under the License.","+ */","+package org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.core.commands.tui;","+","+import java.util.ArrayList;","+import java.util.List;","+import java.util.Locale;","+import java.util.Map;","+","+import dev.tamboui.layout.Constraint;","+import dev.tamboui.layout.Layout;","+import dev.tamboui.layout.Rect;","+import dev.tamboui.style.Style;","+import dev.tamboui.terminal.Frame;","+import dev.tamboui.text.Line;","+import dev.tamboui.text.Span;","+import dev.tamboui.text.Text;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.block.Block;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.block.BorderType;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.block.Borders;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.paragraph.Paragraph;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.table.Cell;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.table.Row;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.table.Table;","+import dev.tamboui.widgets.table.TableState;","+import org.apache.camel.util.json.JsonArray;","+import org.apache.camel.util.json.JsonObject;","+","+import static org.apache.camel.dsl.jbang.core.commands.tui.TuiHelper.hint;","+","+/**","+ * The chaos screen (camel-chaos): whether chaos is on, the verdict of the report, the current rules with their live","+ * state (the observed rate, when a rule last fired, its faults per second over the last minute as a sparkline, and the","+ * effect of its faults on the exchanges), the selected rule in detail with its recent faults, and the counts per route","+ * of the report. It only reads: rules are added, changed and removed with {@code camel cmd chaos-*}.","+ */","+class ChaosTab extends AbstractTableTab {","+","+    private static final String SPARK = \"▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█\";","+    // the width of the sparkline in the rules table: the 60 seconds, 4 per column","+    private static final int TABLE_SPARK = 15;","+    private static final int ROUTES_WIDTH = 46;","+","+    ChaosTab(MonitorContext ctx) {","+        super(ctx);","+    }","+","+    @Override","+    protected boolean selectsFirstRow() {","+        return true;","+    }","+","+    @Override","+    protected int getRowCount() {","+        IntegrationInfo info = ctx.findSelectedIntegration();","+        return info != null && info.chaos != null ? info.chaos.rules.size() : 0;","+    }","+","+    @Override","+    protected void renderContent(Frame frame, Rect area, IntegrationInfo info) {","+        ChaosInfo chaos = info.chaos;","+        if (chaos == null || !chaos.enabled) {","+            String why = chaos == null","+                    ? \"camel-chaos is not in this integration: run it with camel run --chaos\"","+                    : chaos.reason != null ? chaos.reason : \"Chaos is off\";","+            frame.renderWidget(Paragraph.builder()","+                    .text(Text.from(Line.from(Span.raw(\"\")), Line.from(Span.styled(\"  \" + why, Theme.muted()))))","+                    .block(block(\" Chaos \"))","+                    .build(), area);","+            return;","+        }","+        int tableHeight = Math.max(5, Math.min(chaos.rules.size() + 3, area.height() / 3));","+        List<Rect> rows = Layout.vertical()","+                .constraints(Constraint.length(4), Constraint.length(tableHeight), Constraint.fill())","+                .split(area);","+        renderVerdict(frame, rows.get(0), chaos);","+        renderRules(frame, rows.get(1), chaos, info.name);","+        List<Rect> bottom = Layout.horizontal()","+                .constraints(Constraint.fill(), Constraint.length(ROUTES_WIDTH))","+                .split(rows.get(2));","+        renderDetail(frame, bottom.get(0), chaos, selectedRule(chaos));","+        renderRoutes(frame, bottom.get(1), chaos);","+    }","+","+    private ChaosInfo.Rule selectedRule(ChaosInfo chaos) {","+        Integer sel = tableState.selected();","+        return sel != null && sel >= 0 && sel < chaos.rules.size() ? chaos.rules.get(sel) : null;","+    }","+","+    // ---- the verdict ----","+","+    private static void renderVerdict(Frame frame, Rect area, ChaosInfo chaos) {","+        boolean fail = \"FAIL\".equals(chaos.verdict);","+        List<Span> first = new ArrayList<>();","+        first.add(Span.raw(\" \"));","+        first.add(Span.styled(chaos.verdict != null ? chaos.verdict : \"-\",","+                (fail ? Theme.error() : Theme.success()).bold()));","+        first.add(Span.raw(\"   \"));","+        first.add(Span.styled(\"lost \", Theme.muted()));","+        first.add(Span.styled(String.valueOf(chaos.lost), chaos.lost > 0 ? Theme.error() : Style.EMPTY));","+        long met = 0;","+        long unmet = 0;","+        long pending = 0;","+        long waiting = 0;","+        for (ChaosInfo.Rule r : chaos.rules) {","+            if (\"met\".equals(r.expectOutcome)) {","+                met++;","+            } else if (\"unmet\".equals(r.expectOutcome)) {","+                unmet++;","+            } else if (\"pending\".equals(r.expectOutcome)) {","+                pending++;","+            }","+            if (\"waiting\".equals(r.state)) {","+                waiting++;","+            }","+        }","+        if (met + unmet + pending > 0) {","+            first.add(Span.styled(\"   expectations \", Theme.muted()));","+            first.add(Span.styled(met + \" met\", Theme.success()));","+            first.add(Span.raw(\" · \"));","+            first.add(Span.styled(unmet + \" unmet\", unmet > 0 ? Theme.error() : Style.EMPTY));","+            first.add(Span.raw(\" · \"));","+            first.add(Span.styled(pending + \" pending\", pending > 0 ? Theme.warning() : Style.EMPTY));","+        }","+        first.add(Span.styled(\"   faults \", Theme.muted()));","+        first.add(Span.raw(String.valueOf(chaos.faultsLastMinute())));","+        first.add(Span.styled(\" in the last minute\", Theme.muted()));","+        first.add(Span.styled(\"   rules \", Theme.muted()));","+        first.add(Span.raw((chaos.activeRules() - waiting) + \" active\"","+                           + (waiting > 0 ? \" · \" + waiting + \" waiting\" : \"\")));","+        // the seed is in the title; the reason of a failed verdict, or what the verdict waits for","+        Line second;","+        if (!chaos.reasons.isEmpty()) {","+            second = Line.from(Span.styled(\" \" + TuiIcons.CROSS + \" \" + chaos.reasons.get(0)","+                                           + (chaos.reasons.size() > 1 ? \" (+\" + (chaos.reasons.size() - 1) + \" more)\" : \"\"),","+                    Theme.error()));","+        } else if (!chaos.isFinal) {","+            second = Line.from(Span.styled(\" not final: an expectation is pending\", Theme.muted()));","+        } else {","+            second = Line.from(Span.raw(\"\"));","+        }","+        frame.renderWidget(Paragraph.builder()","+                .text(Text.from(Line.from(first), second))","+                .block(block(\" Chaos ─ on ─ seed \" + chaos.seed + \" \"))","+                .build(), area);","+    }","+","+    // ---- the rules ----","+","+    private void renderRules(Frame frame, Rect area, ChaosInfo chaos, String name) {","+        List<Row> rows = new ArrayList<>();","+        for (ChaosInfo.Rule r : chaos.rules) {","+            rows.add(Row.from(","+                    Cell.from(Span.styled(r.id + (r.version > 1 ? \" v\" + r.version : \"\"), Style.EMPTY.fg(Theme.accent()))),","+                    Cell.from(Span.styled(r.state != null ? r.state : \"\", stateStyle(r.state))),","+                    Cell.from(target(r)),","+                    Cell.from(r.fault()),","+                    Cell.from(rate(r)),","+                    rightCell(String.valueOf(r.fired), 5),","+                    rightCell(r.lastFiredAgo >= 0 ? shortTime(r.lastFiredAgo) : \"-\", 6),","+                    Cell.from(Span.styled(sparkline(r.faultsPerSecond, TABLE_SPARK), Theme.warning())),","+                    Cell.from(Line.from(effect(r))),","+                    Cell.from(Span.styled(note(r), T